        \sum_{h=1}^H \|\mu^\pi_{M,h} - \mu^\pi_{\tM,h}\|_\TV \leq & \sum_{h=1}^H \EE_{\pi,M}[\sum_{\ph=1}^{h-1} L_\Gamma^{h-h'-1} \|\mP_{T,\ph}(\cdot|s_\ph,a_\ph,\mu^\pi_{M,\ph}) - \mP_{\tT,\ph}(\cdot|s_\ph,a_\ph,\mu^\pi_{M,\ph})\|_\TV] \\
        %
        \leq & \sum_{h=1}^{H} \frac{1 }{1 - L_\Gamma}\EE_{\pi,M}[\|\mP_{T,h}(\cdot|s_h,a_h,\mu^\pi_{M,h}) - \mP_{\tT,h}(\cdot|s_h,a_h,\mu^\pi_{M,h})\|_\TV]. \tag{$L_\Gamma < 1$}
    \end{align*}

A tight enough upper bound is:
